These features make the early game more easy than in 3.1. Before the
introduction of weapon skills, each character was "Basic" in all skills
and could not use two-weapon combat. Sokoban gives a very valuable item
(to those who are patient enough), and even alchemy can be used
profitably early on.

Green slimes, master mind flayers and the new summoning abilities come
into effect later in the game.

